---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Figure from '../components/Figure.astro';
import portrait from '../assets/joe.jpg';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <Figure src={portrait} alt="Joe Caterine" float="right" width={220} />
    <p>I'm Joe Caterine, the web and content strategist at William & Mary's VIMS & Batten School, a marine science institute. Since I started in August 2025, I've rolled out a web governance structure supporting 30 web editors, coordinated a content cleanup that removed over 20,000 outdated assets, and led the remediation of web accessibility issues ahead of the (original) April 2026 WCAG 2.1 compliance deadline. I post about my latest VIMS web projects on <a href ="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jwcaterine/">LinkedIn</a>.
    </p>

    <p>
    Before my current position, I was the Digital Experience Manager at Virginia Sea Grant, where I led the development of the <a href="https://aquainfoexchange.org">Aquaculture Information Exchange</a> — a NOAA/USDA-backed platform for the American aquaculture community that grew from 200 to 2,000+ members under my watch.
    </p>

    <p>
    My interest in web development and programming started when I was a journalist. One example is <a href="https://virginiamercury.com/2023/06/26/more-patients-in-crisis-falling-through-cracks-of-state-psychiatric-commitment-system/">a piece I did for the Virginia Mercury</a>, where I analyzed data from the Department of Behavioral Health and Developmental Services to plot a rise in mental health crisis events over the past decade. I also published a <a href="https://youtu.be/x9IDL8eruAw?si=eNvPyfSwFWVYBjPP">walkthrough on YouTube</a> explaining how I used PDFplumber to extract the data.
    </p>
    <p>
    In my spare time, I enjoy vibe coding games for my family and building digital tools for myself, like a simple <a href="https://github.com/gam32bit/workout-tracker">mobile-first workout tracker</a>. 
    </p>
    <p>
    I live in coastal Virginia. You can find me on <a href="https://github.com/gam32bit">GitHub</a>, <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/jwcat757.bsky.social">Bluesky</a>, or reach me at jwcat757 [at] gmail [dot] com.
    </p>
</BaseLayout>
